v5.15.2 24th November 2020
  - Removed the PyQt-builder documentation.

v5.15.1 12th September 2020
  - Updated the documentation for PyQt v5.15.1.
  - Documented the PYQTBUILD_VERSION and PYQTBUILD_VERSION_STR attributes of
    the pyqtbuild module.
  - Documented the android-abis project option to PyQt-builder.

v5.15.0 1st June 2020
  - Updated the documentation for PyQt v5.15.0.
  - Documented the --ignore-missing option to pyqt-bundle.

v5.14.1 5th May 2020
  - Documented the --exclude option to pyqt-bundle.
  - Documented the target-qt-dir project option to PyQt-builder.
  - Documented the removal of the need for pyqtlicense.

